icon_user_check on_unfollow\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" version=\"1.1\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow wintrmut3</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following wintrmut3</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/login?intent=add_to_collection&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fwintrmut3.itch.io%2Fatavistic\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" version=\"1.1\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://wintrmut3.itch.io/atavistic#comments\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" version=\"1.1\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Comments</a></li><li class=\"jam_entry\"><a class=\"action_btn\" href=\"https://itch.io/jam/utgddc-gmd-2022-23/rate/1855907\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_award\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" version=\"1.1\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"7\"></circle><polyline points=\"8.21 13.89 7 23 12 20 17 23 15.79 13.88\"></polyline></svg>Submission to utGDDC Game Making Deathmatch 2022/23</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/1855907/atavistic\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\" target=\"_blank\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" role=\"img\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" stroke=\"currentColor\" version=\"1.1\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_lato\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">atavistic</h1></div><div id=\"view_html_game_7465751\" class=\"view_html_game_page view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download ready\"><div id=\"html_embed_3461140\" class=\"html_embed_widget base_widget embed_wrapper\"><div data-width=\"960\" data-height=\"540\" style=\"width: 960px; height: 540px\" class=\"game_frame game_pending\"><div data-iframe=\"&lt;iframe scrolling=&quot;no&quot; src=&quot;https://html-classic.itch.zone/html/7265648/v10-web/index.html?v=1782716338&quot; allow=&quot;autoplay; fullscreen *; geolocation; microphone; camera; midi; monetization; xr-spatial-tracking; gamepad; gyroscope; accelerometer; xr; cross-origin-isolated; web-share&quot; allowtransparency=&quot;true&quot; webkitallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; mozallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; msallowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot; id=&quot;game_drop&quot; frameborder=&quot;0&quot; allowfullscreen=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;\" class=\"iframe_placeholder\"><button class=\"button load_iframe_btn\"><svg stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" class=\"svgicon icon_play\" role=\"img\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" version=\"1.1\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polygon points=\"10 8 16 12 10 16 10 8\"></polygon></svg> Run game</button></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Atavistic is a casual card-based &quot;farming&quot; simulator made in 2 months for UTGDDC&#x27;s Game Making Deathmatch. The only things not made during these two months were a few utility scripts and a handful of sprites.<br></p>\r\n<p>In this game, you play as an unnamed creature bound beneath the arctic wastes. A party of overenthusiastic miners hailing from the Hyperion Mining Company has made landfall on your little home, and are ripe for the harvest! <br></p>\r\n<p>I suggest you relax and play this game without trying too hard to win. It is pretty hard to lose, since you&#x27;d need to let all your units die and they have a lot of HP. This game is first and foremost a simulation, with a little interactivity and rickety game mechanics added in, so you should just watch the colony evolve and survive (or not).<br></p>\r\n<p>Please read the tutorial prompts as they come up, but you can find a guide below on how to win the game.<br></p><p><strong>Controls</strong></p><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Input</strong></td><td><strong>Effect</strong></td></tr><tr><td>W/A/S/D</td><td>Pan camera up / left / down / right</td></tr><tr><td>Q/E</td><td>Zoom camera in/out</td></tr><tr><td>TAB</td><td>Open Card Shop</td></tr><tr><td>Left Click on Card</td><td>Use hovered card (read top of screen for instructions)</td></tr><tr><td>Right Click on Card</td><td>Discard hovered card</td></tr><tr><td><em>(secret) Left/Right Bracket [ / ]</em></td><td><em>Changes game speed. Not recommended, I think it plays best at timescale of 1 but if you want to skip early game you can use this.</em></td></tr></tbody></table><p><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Game Guide</strong><br></p>\r\n<p>1. Use W/A/S/D + Q/E to navigate the map. Observe points where penguins cluster.</p>\r\n<p>2. Wait until you have a harvest card, and use it on a man near a penguin cluster. This should surface a Tether, one of three binding you in place.</p>\r\n<p>3. Use &lt;Tab&gt; to open up the Card Shop, and purchase a few cards with the Myth points you&#x27;ve earned through harvest. Notice some synergies - smite + vortex, multiply +&nbsp;multiply, etc.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>4. Allow the game to progress, using smite and other cards to clear away threats as the mining colony develops. Use Regrowth occasionally to ensure you don&#x27;t run out of trees. Continue harvesting until you&#x27;ve located all three tethers (tethers may be found where penguins cluster, and units will naturally gravitate around 3 points on the map!)</p><p>5. Harvest around the tethers - you&#x27;ll see a skull floating from the player to the tether if you&#x27;re in range, and hear a chime and visual effect when you&#x27;ve&nbsp;broken them. It takes 10 harvests near a tether to break it - you&#x27;ll also notice the particle effect turn black when it&#x27;s done.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Technical Details<br></strong></p>\r\n<p>This game is primarily a world simulator, a sandbox where you play god with some limited powers. There are many convoluted interlocking systems and AIs talking to each other, in hopes that some interesting emergent dynamics will present themselves. Lots of custom shaders, heavy use of particle effects and other graphics tricks, hopefully make a coherent art style. The music was &quot;composed&quot; over a few days, but I threw away most of my previous attempts...I may post them at a later date.</p>\r\n<p>I&#x27;ve recorded probably 10h of footage making this game, and will be working on a devlog for the next while for my <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCuajyE6kZ9yU-qypGoJmXeQ\" target=\"_blank\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Youtube Channel - Wintermute Digital</a><br></p>\r\n<p>The idea for this game has been in my head for several years, and you can see my attempts at creating it in the other games I&#x27;ve made, primarily &quot;The Last Lighthouse&quot; and &quot;Maelstrom.exe&quot;. I don&#x27;t think the idea has quite matured yet but this is good progress towards something playable.<br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a class=\"toggle_info_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0)\">More information<svg height=\"6\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" role=\"img\" width=\"12\" aria-hidden version=\"1.1\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.0684-0.932-1.9331-2.086-1.9331-0.577 0-1.111 0.23008-1.49 0.57992l-14.924 13.894-14.925-13.893c-0.3777-0.34998-0.9134-0.581-1.4902-0.581z\"/></svg></a></div><div class=\"info_panel_wrapper\"><div id=\"game_info_panel_1614314\" class=\"game_info_panel_widget base_widget\"><table><tbody><tr><td>Status</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/released\">Released</a></td></tr><tr><td>Platforms</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/html5\">HTML5</a></td></tr><tr><td>Author</td><td><a href=\"https://wintrmut3.itch.io\">wintrmut3</a></td></tr><tr><td>Genre</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-card-game\">Card Game</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/genre-simulation\">Simulation</a></td></tr><tr><td>Tags</td><td><a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-casual\">Casual</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-farming\">Farming</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-god-game\">god-game</a>, <a href=\"https://itch.io/games/tag-sandbox\">Sandbox</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div><div class=\"uploads\"><h2 id=\"download\">Download</h2><div id=\"upload_list_1891947\" class=\"upload_list_widget base_widget\"><div class=\"upload\"><a data-upload_id=\"7260697\" class=\"button download_btn\" href=\"javascript:void(0);\">Download</a><div class=\"info_column\"><div class=\"upload_name\"><strong class=\"name\" title=\"v10-windows.zip\">v10-windows.zip</strong> <span class=\"file_size\"><span>26 MB</span></span> <span class=\"download_platforms\"></span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"download_instructions \"><h2 id=\"instructions\">Install instructions</h2><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Unzip and run utgddc22.exe for Windows build, runs in fullscreen 1920x1080 or play it in the browser!<br></p>\r\n<p><del>Note - There was a web build, but it is broken for no apparent reason so I am only leaving the windows build up until I can debug. </del>Fixed - TIL webgl doesn&#x27;t support compute shaders.<br></p></div></div><div id=\"game_comments_8339406\" class=\"game_comments_widget base_widget\"><h2 id=\"comments\">Leave a comment</h2><p class=\"form_placeholder\"><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fwintrmut3.itch.io%2Fatavistic\" data-register_action=\"comment\">Log in with itch.io</a> to leave a comment.</p><div id=\"community_topic_posts_7303374\" class=\"community_topic_posts_widget base_widget\"><div id=\"community_post_list_8788834\" class=\"community_post_list_widget base_widget\"><script id=\"vote_counts_tpl\" type=\"text/template\"><% if (up_score > 0) { %><span class=\"upvotes\">(+{{up_score}})</span><% } %><% if (down_score > 0) { %><span class=\"downvotes\">(-{{down_score}})</span><% } %></script></div></div></div></div><div class=\"right_col column\"><div class=\"video_embed\"></div><div class=\"screenshot_list\"><a data-image_lightbox=\"true\" href=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvMTg1NTkwNy8xMTE4NzM3NC5naWY=/original/5MdJDT.gif\" target=\"_blan